      "id": "budget_artifact_text",
      "x": 105,
      "y": 1422,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "BudgetLedger\nreserve_worst_case(action) atomically\nlimits: model_calls • tool_calls • tokens • dollars • deadline\nsettle(actuals) → remaining budget\nunavoidable provider overrun is recorded, never hidden",
