      "id": "run_ledger_text",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 1430,
      "width": 2910,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "IMMUTABLE RUN LEDGER — every transition emits a versioned RunEvent with parent ID + input/output hashes + budget reservation/actuals\n\nTaskSpec hash  →  SourceSnapshot  →  EvidenceSnapshot  →  BoundProgram  →  DraftPackage  →  VerificationReport  →  RecoveryPlan  →  Terminal state\n\nprovider/model/version • prompts/seeds • adapter/parser/normalizer versions • content hashes • calls/tokens/$/latency • replay lineage",
      "originalText": "IMMUTABLE RUN LEDGER — every transition emits a versioned RunEvent with parent ID + input/output hashes + budget reservation/actuals\n\nTaskSpec hash  →  SourceSnapshot  →  EvidenceSnapshot  →  BoundProgram  →  DraftPackage  →  VerificationReport  →  RecoveryPlan  →  Terminal state\n\nprovider/model/version • prompts/seeds • adapter/parser/normalizer versions • content hashes • calls/tokens/$/latency • replay lineage",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
